@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Mengedit Nama Format Surat Izin Siswa (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Template ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Presensi Siswa" > "Template Surat Izin"
UI -> C: 2. Request template page
C -> DB: 3. Get templates list
DB --> C: 4. Return templates data
C --> UI: 5. Load template page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan daftar template surat

== Edit Nama Template ==
TU -> UI: 7. Klik tombol "Edit" pada kartu template
UI -> C: 8. Request edit mode
C --> UI: 9. Enable edit mode
UI --> TU: 10. Tampilkan field edit nama surat

TU -> UI: 11. Edit nama surat + klik tombol "✓" / "✗"
UI -> C: 12. Handle edit action

alt Simpan perubahan (tombol ✓)
    C -> C: 12.1. Validate nama surat
    C -> DB: 12.2. Update template name
    DB --> C: 12.3. Update successful
    C -> DB: 12.4. Get updated templates list
    DB --> C: 12.5. Return updated data
    C --> UI: 12.6. Success response + refresh data
    UI --> TU: 12.7. "Nama template berhasil diubah" + tampilkan daftar terbaru
else Batal edit (tombol ✗)
    C --> UI: 12.1. Cancel edit mode
    UI --> TU: 12.2. Kembali ke tampilan normal tanpa perubahan
else Nama surat kosong
    C -> C: 12.1. Validate nama surat
    C --> UI: 12.2. Validation error
    UI --> TU: 12.3. "Nama surat tidak boleh kosong"
end

@enduml